# Catching on Route 202. Piplup L8 and ten Poké Balls; the player
# paces in the tall grass north of Sandgem until a wild Pokémon appears, then throws Poké Balls until it is
# caught. The catch joins the party and the Pokédex marks it caught. Save round trip after the battle.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 8
give item platinum:ITEM_POKE_BALL 10
set var platinum:VAR_ROUTE_202_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_202 178 827 up
until idle
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
until battle 900
+0 screenshot catch-command
battle catch platinum:ITEM_POKE_BALL 9000
+0 assert battle wild * caught
+0 assert battles wild 1
+0 assert state party.length 2
+0 assert state pokedex.caught.length 2
# Trainer score (encounter.c UpdateGameRecords, the catch sequence): a regional catch 2, a new species 20.
+0 assert state records.score 22
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
